pothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,s_i,t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(s,t,s_i,t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[t/x]\">\\(\\varphi[t/x]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"237ed61a00bb9297\" href=\"?note=237ed61a00bb9297\" title=\"57-df-substitution-formula\">57-df-substitution-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8216e0b1a4cf9570\" href=\"?note=8216e0b1a4cf9570\" title=\"57-df-free-for\">57-df-free-for</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_H\">\\(\\vdash_H\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"52897755c29c065c\" href=\"?note=52897755c29c065c\" title=\"57-df-hilbert-derivable\">57-df-hilbert-derivable</a>。有限合取按左结合构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\doteq\">\\(\\doteq\\)</span> 是对象语言等号而不是语法对象相等。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset\\vdash_H((\\bigwedge_{i=1}^n s_i\\doteq t_i)\\to(R(\\vec s)\\to R(\\vec t))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"